{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>The Story Rundown\u00a0</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For years, the food conglomerate <i>Spudnik Biosystems</i> has been tinkering with the perfect GMO formula to get the most nutritional value out of food as possible. After creating the miracle element, <i>&quot;Cholesterite&quot;</i>, the town of <i>Tatered Hill</i> becomes infested with all your favorite foods - now demented, ruthless, and human-hungry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After being exposed yourself, the player characters - various chefs from the local food court mall - discover odd changes to their bodies. Work with others camped out in the post-apocalyptic mall alone or Co-Op with up to 4 people to quell the infestation and escape the mall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>Main Features\u00a0</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Food-based enemies</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nasty, uncanny, and disgusting designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique AI behaviors to fight against</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated dungeons</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variety of different rooms, layouts, puzzles and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">American, Mexican, Asian, Dessert, and Health food dungeons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated weapons</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 10,000 different weapon combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 food-based ammo types with different combat and environmental effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scopes, stocks, clips, barrels, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of different kinds of loot to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stat system to level up different player statistics (speed, damage, accuracy, etc.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelite\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dying is dangerous, and will cause you to drop loot, weapons, and clear stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story progression, secrets, and permanent task upgrades are saved throughout runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-Op</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players online</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3077140?t=1743297143","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/1d99abd153698ad437dd1d341aac9c409f078506/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743297143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/818dfbf0d2d5cbcb4f35919ef4fe373f1e13d473/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743297143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/818dfbf0d2d5cbcb4f35919ef4fe373f1e13d473/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743297143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoon Blood\r\nCoarse Language\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>The Story Rundown\u00a0</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For years, the food conglomerate <i>Spudnik Biosystems</i> has been tinkering with the perfect GMO formula to get the most nutritional value out of food as possible. After creating the miracle element